### ===== RESERVATIONS =====

### 1. Phone booking: 2 Standard (Room Only) + 1 Deluxe (Bed & Breakfast), 10 to 13 Mar 2027
# @name createRes
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": 1, "guestId": 1, "source": "Phone",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-10", "checkOut": "2027-03-13",
  "items": [
    { "roomTypeId": 1, "ratePlanId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "roomTypeId": 2, "ratePlanId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 2. Read it back (expect 3 items, totalAmount 17400, status Confirmed, number like RES-2026-000001)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/{{createRes.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Availability for 10 to 11 Mar (expect Standard reserved 2 / available 2, Deluxe reserved 1 / available 2)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2027-03-10&checkOut=2027-03-11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Book the last 2 Standard rooms for the same dates (expect 201)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": 1, "guestId": 1, "source": "Online",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-10", "checkOut": "2027-03-13",
  "items": [ { "roomTypeId": 1, "ratePlanId": 1, "quantity": 2 } ]
}

### 5. One more Standard room (expect 409: Only 0 'Standard' room(s) available...)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": 1, "guestId": 1, "source": "Phone",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-10", "checkOut": "2027-03-13",
  "items": [ { "roomTypeId": 1, "ratePlanId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 6. Back to back: a Standard room from 13 Mar (the others leave that morning). Expect 201
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": 1, "guestId": 1, "source": "Phone",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-13", "checkOut": "2027-03-15",
  "items": [ { "roomTypeId": 1, "ratePlanId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 7. The only Suite, 10 to 13 Mar (expect 201, total 15000)
# @name suite1
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": 1, "guestId": 1, "source": "Phone",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-10", "checkOut": "2027-03-13",
