GET {{host}}/api/reservations?status=banana
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by number or guest name
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?q=RES-2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Arriving in March 2027
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?arrivingFrom=2027-03-01&arrivingTo=2027-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Paging: 2 per page
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?page=1&pageSize=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Not logged in (expect 401): note there is no Authorization line
GET {{host}}/api/reservations

### ===== CHECK-IN =====
# Set these three dates: today, tomorrow, the day after tomorrow
@today = 2026-11-27
@tomorrow = 2026-11-28
@dayAfter = 2026-11-29

### 1. Book 2 Standard rooms arriving today, 2 nights (expect 201, total 6000)
# @name bookA
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": 1, "guestId": 1, "source": "Phone",
  "checkIn": "{{today}}", "checkOut": "{{dayAfter}}",
  "items": [ { "roomTypeId": 1, "ratePlanId": 1, "quantity": 2 } ]
}

### 2. Check them in (expect 200: 2 stays in rooms 101 and 102, each folio balance 3000)
# @name checkinA
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/{{bookA.response.body.$.id}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idType": "NationalId", "idNumber": "ET9988776655", "issuingCountry": "Ethiopia", "expiryDate": "2032-05-01" }

### 3. Rooms by status (expect Clean 6, Occupied 2)
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. The occupied rooms (expect 101 and 102)
GET {{host}}/api/rooms?status=Occupied
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Who is in the hotel? (expect 2 stays, balance 3000 each)
GET {{host}}/api/stays?propertyId=1&status=CheckedIn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. One stay in detail (expect idNumberMasked ********6655, idVerifiedBy Hotel Manager, payAtCheckout true)
GET {{host}}/api/stays/{{checkinA.response.body.$.stays[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. The reservation now says CheckedIn and shows its room numbers
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/{{bookA.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Check in the same reservation again (expect 409: A CheckedIn reservation cannot be checked in)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/{{bookA.response.body.$.id}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idType": "NationalId", "idNumber": "ET9988776655", "issuingCountry": "Ethiopia" }

### 9. Availability today to tomorrow (expect Standard: total 4, reserved 2, available 2)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn={{today}}&checkOut={{tomorrow}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

